==================================================
  DC Motor BEMF PID Controller Commands (115200) 
==================================================
  k / lock      : Run Lock (drives Right to endstop)
  u / unlock    : Run Unlock (drives Left to endstop)
  m<count>      : Cycle between endstops <count> times (e.g. m10)
  l<ms>         : Move Left for <ms> milliseconds (e.g. l500)
  r<ms>         : Move Right for <ms> milliseconds (e.g. r500)
  s             : Emergency Stop
  t<val>        : Set Target Speed setpoint (e.g. t140)
  p<val>        : Set Kp gain (e.g. p1.8)
  i<val>        : Set Ki gain (e.g. i0.8)
  d<val>        : Set Kd gain (e.g. d0.0)
  ff<val>       : Set Feed-Forward gain (e.g. ff1.35)
  min<val>      : Set Minimum Active PWM (e.g. min45)
  cal<adc>      : Set Max BEMF ADC calibration counts (default 573)
  plot          : Toggle Real-time Serial Plotter (Target,Speed,PWM,V)
  ? or h        : Print Help & Current Status
==================================================

